US2013303863A1,Patient Monitoring Apparatus,"A patient monitoring system including a sensing-recording device that attaches to a patient and a probe utilized by attending personnel at a trauma site. After an initial interaction between the probe and the sensing-recording device, the sensing-recording device samples one or more physiological parameters and stores time stamped readings in a first memory. The probe is adapted to take other measurements, download the data from the first memory of the sensing-recording device, manipulate the collective data and return data to a second memory in the sensing-recording device. The sensing-recording device continues to accumulate data in the first memory during transport of the patient from a trauma site to a medical facility.","['A61B5/00', 'G16H40/67']","['A61B', 'G16H']",34,1.0,US20230270344A1,"A61B5/02405,A61B5/01,A61B5/16,A61B5/02055,A61B5/7221,G16H40/00,H,Y02A,A61B2562/0233,G16H40/67,A61B5/165,A61B5/316,A61B5/6813,A61B5/0082,A61B5/0004,A61B5/0002,A61B5/369,A61B5/091,A61B5/6801,G16,H04R1/02,A61B5/683,A61B5/725,A61B5/6825,A61B5/1118,A61B5/0059,A61B5/0295,A61B5/4884,A61B5/0022,A61B5/021,A61B5/02433,G16H20/30,G16H30/40,A61B5/6817,A61B2560/0425,A61B5/414,A61B5/024,A61B5/02416,A61B5/0015,A61B5/4845,Y02A90/10,A61B5/7282,H04R1/1091,A61B2560/00,A61B5/1107,A61B5/72,A61B5/145,A61B5/0816,G16H30/00,A61B2560/02,H04R,A61B5/0084,H04R1/00,G16H50/00,G02B6/00,A61B5/0205,A61B5/6814,A61B2562/00,Y,A61B5/14551,H04R1/105,G02,G,A61B2560/0242,A61B5/14532,A61B5/415,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B2560/0406,H04R1/028,A61B5/486,A61B5/7475,A61B5/48,A61B5/1455,A61B5/7235,A,A61B5/7278,A61B5/4869,A61B5/742,A61B5/4866,G16H,Y02A90/00,G16H50/20,A61B5/6803,A61B5/0013,A61B5/0261,G02B6/0001,A61B5/74,A61B5/0024,A61B5/41,A61B2560/04,A61B5/7207,A61B5/02427,A61B5/11,A61,H04R1/10,A61B2560/0443,G02B,H04,A61B5/24,A61B5/418,A61B5/002,A61B,A61B5/4875,A61B5/6802,A61B5/6826,A61B5/02,A61B2562/0219,G16H20/00,A61B5/103,G16H40/63,A61B5/6816,A61B5/026,A61B5/721,A61B5/411,A61B5/7203