US2021401516A1,Guided setup for teleoperated medical device,A teleoperational medical system for performing a medical procedure in a surgical field includes a dynamic guided setup system having step-by-step setup instructions for setting up a teleoperational assembly having at least one motorized surgical arm configured to assist in a surgical procedure. It also includes a user interface configured to communicate the step-by-step setup instructions to a user. The dynamic guided setup system is configured to automatically recognize completion of a first setup step based on detected physical arrangement of at least one surgical arm on a teleoperational assembly and automatically display a prompt for a subsequent setup step after the recognizing completion of the first setup step.,"['A61B34/30', 'G16H20/40']","['A61B', 'G16H']",37,1.0,US20230200909A1,"A61B17/17,A61B2090/061,A61B90/06,A61B2090/365,G16H40/00,A61B2034/258,A61B2017/00725,A61B2034/107,G16,G16H20/40,A61B17/1626,A61B17/16,A61B2034/2046,A61F2/30,A61B2034/101,A61B34/30,A61B2017/00017,A61B17/1764,A61F,A61B2034/2055,A61B90/08,A61B17/142,A61B17/154,A61F2/46,A61B2090/395,A61B2017/00026,A61B2090/065,A61B2017/00199,A61B2034/2068,G,A61B17/1675,A61B90/39,G16H40/60,A61B2090/0807,A61B17/15,A61B2034/105,A61B2090/0811,A61B90/37,A61B2017/320052,A,G16H,A61F2/02,A61B2034/102,A61F2/00,A61B90/90,A61B2034/108,A61F2002/4632,A61B17/1703,A61B2017/00022,A61,A61B17/1613,A61B2090/367,A61B90/10,A61B2017/00221,A61B2090/064,A61B2090/0812,A61B2090/3937,A61B17/00,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B17/1662,G16H20/00,G16H40/63,A61B34/20,A61B90/11,A61B2090/364,A61F2002/4633,A61B2034/256,A61B90/36,A61B17/1739,A61B34/10,A61B17/32,A61B2017/00212,A61B2034/254,A61B2090/372,A61B2017/00681,A61B90/00,A61B17/14,A61B34/25,A61B2034/104,A61B2034/2072","A number of improvements are provided relating to computer aided surgery. The improvement relates to both the methods used during computer aided surgery and the devices used during such procedures. Some of the improvement