US2018361238A1,Delphi method for medical coding,"Systems and methods provide confirmation of accuracy of determining medical codes for medical records. The technology may include processor control instructions or steps for establishing a collection of medical documents as a test sample and for determining a convergence of assigned medical codes for the sample that have been assigned by a plurality of coders to establish a standard of one or more accepted medical codes for the sample. The technology may include instructions for applying the sample to a coding system to obtain a determined medical code for the sample; and for comparing the determined code to the accepted medical codes to rate the coding system&#39;s accuracy. In some embodiments, the determined medical codes may be obtained by a software coding algorithm that automatically assigns medical codes to medical records. Moreover, the comparing step may be performed by an algorithm that automatically calculates a rate of the coding system.","['G16H10/60', 'G06F19/32']","['G16H', 'G06F']",45,1.0,US20230200909A1,"A61B17/17,A61B2090/061,A61B90/06,A61B2090/365,G16H40/00,A61B2034/258,A61B2017/00725,A61B2034/107,G16,G16H20/40,A61B17/1626,A61B17/16,A61B2034/2046,A61F2/30,A61B2034/101,A61B34/30,A61B2017/00017,A61B17/1764,A61F,A61B2034/2055,A61B90/08,A61B17/142,A61B17/154,A61F2/46,A61B2090/395,A61B2017/00026,A61B2090/065,A61B2017/00199,A61B2034/2068,G,A61B17/1675,A61B90/39,G16H40/60,A61B2090/0807,A61B17/15,A61B2034/105,A61B2090/0811,A61B90/37,A61B2017/320052,A,G16H,A61F2/02,A61B2034/102,A61F2/00,A61B90/90,A61B2034/108,A61F2002/4632,A61B17/1703,A61B2017/00022,A61,A61B17/1613,A61B2090/367,A61B90/10,A61B2017/00221,A61B2090/064,A61B2090/0812,A61B2090/3937,A61B17/00,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B17/1662,G16H20/00,G16H40/63,A61B34/20,A61B90/11,A61B2090/364,A61F2002/4633,A61B2034/256,A61B90/36,A61B17/1739,A61B34/10,A61B17/32,A61B2017/00212,A61B2034/254,A61B2090/372,A61B2017/00681,A61B90/00,A61B17/14,A61B34/25,A61B2034/104,A61B2034/207