US2019125214A1,Measuring respiratory parameters from an ecg device,"Methods, systems, and devices for measuring respiratory parameters from an ECG device are described. The method may include receiving an electrocardiogram (ECG) signal associated with a patient. The method may further include detecting a change in modulation of the ECG signal between a first portion of the ECG signal and a second portion of the ECG signal. The method may further include determining a change in respiratory effort of the patient based at least in part on the change in modulation.","['A61B5/00', 'G16H10/60']","['A61B', 'G16H']",26,1.0,US20230218347A1,"G06V10/46,G06V20/698,G06T2207/20112,G06T7/13,A61B5/05,A61M,G01R,A61B6/481,A61B8/52,Y02A,G16H50/30,A61B5/6867,G06T7/00,G06F17/00,G06F18/10,G06F17/10,A61B6/5217,G01R33/5601,G01R33/563,G06T2211/00,G06T15/10,A61B8/5223,A61B5/055,A61B2034/107,G16,A61B5/107,A61B5/22,G06T11/001,G06T7/0002,A61B5/1118,G06G7/48,G06G,G06T2207/10088,G06F30/00,G06T11/60,G01R33/56,A61M5/007,A61B5/029,A61B8/02,A61B8/48,A61B6/48,G06F18/20,A61B8/00,A61B5/6847,A61B8/04,G06V20/60,A61B6/503,G06G7/00,A61B2034/101,G01R33/20,G06T2207/00,G06T2207/10012,G06F30/28,A61B5/745,A61B2090/3762,A61B2576/00,G06V40/14,A61B5/021,G16H30/40,A61B5/1075,G06V10/42,G06T17/005,G06T11/20,G06T7/74,G06T7/12,G06T2207/30016,A61B8/5215,G06T2207/10004,A61B8/481,G06T7/10,A61B5/0033,G06T2210/41,G06V10/40,A61B5/024,A61B5/02028,Y02A90/10,G06F30/20,G16H50/50,A61B5/72,G06V10/467,G16B45/00,A61B5/02007,G06T11/008,A61B5/0263,G16H30/00,G01R33/5635,G06T7/70,A61B2576/023,G16H50/00,A61B5/0044,G06F18/24,Y,G06T17/20,A61B5/6852,A61B6/03,G06T7/11,G01,G,A61B6/504,G06T7/0014,A61B5/68,G01R33/48,G06T2207/10,G16B5/00,G06T2207/10081,G06T2207/30004,A61B6/5229,G06V10/00,A61B2034/105,G06T2207/30,A61B90/37,A61B5/48,G06T2207/30048,G06T2210/00,G06T7/62,A61B5/7235,A,A61B5/7278,A61B5/742,G16H,G06T2207/30104,A61B8/5238,G06F18/00,G06T7/0012,A61B2090/3764,Y02A90/00,G06T7/73,A61B2034/102,A61B2090/376,G06T7/60,A61B6/00,A61B2034/108,A61B6/5