US2010179835A1,Relating multiple electronic health records,"A computer-implemented method for alerting one or more members of a connected health network is provided, wherein the connected health network includes two or more members having linked medical records. The method includes receiving a change in a first health record of a first member, the first health record being linked to a second health record of a second member based on a specified relationship. The method also includes using the change in the first health record to determine whether a condition exists that could affect the second member, and, if so, alerting the second member of the affect of the change in the first health record on the second member.","['G06Q50/00', 'G16H10/60']","['G06Q', 'G16H']",29,1.0,US20230253090A1,"A61B5/02405,A61B5/7221,A61B5/4815,G16H40/00,A61B5/05,A61B5/1112,A61B2562/227,A63B24/0087,A61B2562/0233,A61B5/6813,A61B5/0082,A61B5/0004,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6824,A61B5/6801,G16,A63B2024/0065,A61B5/683,A61B5/1118,G16H20/40,A63B2220/803,A61B5/0059,A63B2230/00,A61B5/7267,A61B5/681,A61B5/053,A61B2560/0204,G16H20/30,A61B5/7285,A61B2562/0257,A61B5/024,A61B5/02416,A63B24/0003,A61B5/0015,A61B2560/0214,A61B5/7282,A61B2560/00,A61B5/72,A63B,A63B2230/04,A61B2560/02,A61B2562/0238,A61B5/0205,A61B5/0533,A61B2562/00,A61B2562/225,A61B5/6829,G,A61B5/0531,G06F1/00,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B5/6844,A61B5/7475,A63B2225/00,A61B5/48,A63B24/0075,A61B5/44,A61B5/7235,A,A61B5/7278,A61B5/742,G16H,A61B5/4866,A63B2220/80,A63B2225/50,A63B2230/06,A61B5/74,A61B2560/04,G06F1/16,A61B5/02427,A61B5/4809,A61B5/11,A61,G06F1/163,A61B2560/0443,G06F,A61B5/0255,A61B,G06F1/1613,A61B5/6802,A61B2562/0219,A61B5/02,A61B2560/0475,G16H20/00,A61B2562/22,A61B5/103,G16H40/63,A61B5/6831,A63B24/0062,A61B5/4806,A61B5/441,A61B5/4812,A61B5/7264,A61B5/00,A63,A63B24/00,A61B5/02438,A61B5/684,A61B5/7271,A61B2562/02,A61B5/0022,G06,A63B2220/00","A wearable physiological measurement system may include, inter alia, sensors and circuitry for automatically a