US2021327577A1,System and method for monitoring patient state,"A patient state monitoring system and a method for monitoring patient state are disclosed. The patient state monitoring system includes a monitoring device and a monitoring module communicationally connected to the monitoring device, the monitoring module being worn on the patient&#39;s body. The patient state monitoring system also includes a processor that obtains parameters, and sets the operating mode of a monitoring module according to the obtained parameters, where the operating mode of the monitoring module comprises a continuous monitoring module and an intermittent monitoring mode. By use of the patient state monitoring system and method, during the monitoring of a patient, strict monitoring of the user&#39;s physical condition can be satisfied and the processing of redundant data can be reduced, thereby improving monitoring efficiency and quality.","['G16H40/40', 'G16H40/20']","['G16H', 'G16H']",32,1.0,US20230253090A1,"A61B5/02405,A61B5/7221,A61B5/4815,G16H40/00,A61B5/05,A61B5/1112,A61B2562/227,A63B24/0087,A61B2562/0233,A61B5/6813,A61B5/0082,A61B5/0004,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6824,A61B5/6801,G16,A63B2024/0065,A61B5/683,A61B5/1118,G16H20/40,A63B2220/803,A61B5/0059,A63B2230/00,A61B5/7267,A61B5/681,A61B5/053,A61B2560/0204,G16H20/30,A61B5/7285,A61B2562/0257,A61B5/024,A61B5/02416,A63B24/0003,A61B5/0015,A61B2560/0214,A61B5/7282,A61B2560/00,A61B5/72,A63B,A63B2230/04,A61B2560/02,A61B2562/0238,A61B5/0205,A61B5/0533,A61B2562/00,A61B2562/225,A61B5/6829,G,A61B5/0531,G06F1/00,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B5/6844,A61B5/7475,A63B2225/00,A61B5/48,A63B24/0075,A61B5/44,A61B5/7235,A,A61B5/7278,A61B5/742,G16H,A61B5/4866,A63B2220/80,A63B2225/50,A63B2230/06,A61B5/74,A61B2560/04,G06F1/16,A61B5/02427,A61B5/4809,A61B5/11,A61,G06F1/163,A61B2560/0443,G06F,A61B5/0255,A61B,G06F1/1613,A61B5/6802,A61B2562/0219,A61B5/02,A61B2560/0475,G16H20/00,A61B2562/22,A61B5/103,G16H40/63,A61B5/6831,A63B24/0062,A61B5/4806,A61B5/441,A61B5/4812,A61B5/7264