US2010256993A1,Method And System For Defining And Interactively Managing A Watched Diet,"A method for interactive defining and managing of a controlled diet, prescribed to a patient by a doctor/dietician or another operator authorized to such function, includes the asynchronous execution of at least two different operational cycles. A first operational cycle is effected through an interactive terminal, for example a mobile phone, with which the above mentioned patient is equipped substantially for each meal consumed by the patient. The interactive terminal runs a program, which is started on patient&#39;s command, and which operates on the basis of dietary order made by the doctor/dietician for the patient. The first operational cycle includes a step, in which the foods to be consumed in a given meal are chosen from a fist food data base, a step of quantification of the chosen food and a step of assessment of the congruity of the choices made by the patient with what is prescribed by the order. The first operational cycle includes also a step, during which data related to the quantities and to the composition of the food chosen by the patient are put at the disposal on the data transmission line. A second operational cycle executed by the doctor/dietician on a central processing unit,","['G06F19/00', 'G16H20/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",7,1.0,US20230238131A1,"G06Q50/22,A61,G01N33/487,G01N,G01,G06Q50/10,G,A61B5/01,A61B5/14532,G16H40/00,G01N33/00,G16H40/60,G01N33/483,Y02A,A61B2560/0238,G16H40/67,A61B,G01N33/48792,A61B5/1486,A61B5/0002,A,G16H40/63,G16H,Y02,G01N33/48785,G16,Y02A90/00,A61B5/0015,A61B2560/0223,Y02A90/10,A61B5/0017,A61B2560/00,A61B5/72,G06Q50/00,A61B5/00,A61B5/145,A61B2560/02,G01N33/48,G06Q,A61B5/0022,G06,Y","Methods and devices to monitor an analyte in body fluid are provided. Embodiments include continuous or discrete acquisition of analyte related data from a transcutaneously positioned in vivo analyte sensor automatically or upon request from a user. The i