US2021401516A1,Guided setup for teleoperated medical device,A teleoperational medical system for performing a medical procedure in a surgical field includes a dynamic guided setup system having step-by-step setup instructions for setting up a teleoperational assembly having at least one motorized surgical arm configured to assist in a surgical procedure. It also includes a user interface configured to communicate the step-by-step setup instructions to a user. The dynamic guided setup system is configured to automatically recognize completion of a first setup step based on detected physical arrangement of at least one surgical arm on a teleoperational assembly and automatically display a prompt for a subsequent setup step after the recognizing completion of the first setup step.,"['A61B34/30', 'G16H20/40']","['A61B', 'G16H']",37,1.0,US20230190412A1,"B33,A61C7/10,A61,B44C1/22,A61C19/06,G06Q30/0641,B33Y10/00,B33Y30/00,B44C,B,B44C1/228,G,A61C7/002,B23K26/00,A44C,A61C7/00,A61C7/08,G06Q30/0621,A61C13/0003,B29C64/386,G06Q30/0643,B33Y50/00,B44C1/00,B33Y,B29C,G06Q30/0601,B29C64/30,B23K26/362,G06Q,A61C19/063,A44,B44,G06Q30/06,A,B44C1/227,G16H20/00,A61C2201/007,G16H,A44C15/007,A61C13/00,A61C2201/00,G16,B23,A44C15/0045,A61C13/0013,G16H20/40,B23K26/36,A61C13/0019,B29,B33Y80/00,A61C13/0006,A61C,B23K,G06Q30/00,A44C15/00,A61C19/00,B29C64/00,A61C19/066,G06","Systems, methods, and devices for producing appliances for expansion of the arch of a patient are provided. An arch expanding appliance comprises a force generating portion to apply an arch expansion force and a retention portion to hold the force generating portion on the teeth. The retention portion comprises a flexible portion and a stiff portion. The force generating portion applies a force to move teeth associated with the flexible portion, while the stiff portion resists movement of its associated teeth. The orthodontic appliances can be designed according to the specifications provided herein and manufactured using direct