US2021401516A1,Guided setup for teleoperated medical device,A teleoperational medical system for performing a medical procedure in a surgical field includes a dynamic guided setup system having step-by-step setup instructions for setting up a teleoperational assembly having at least one motorized surgical arm configured to assist in a surgical procedure. It also includes a user interface configured to communicate the step-by-step setup instructions to a user. The dynamic guided setup system is configured to automatically recognize completion of a first setup step based on detected physical arrangement of at least one surgical arm on a teleoperational assembly and automatically display a prompt for a subsequent setup step after the recognizing completion of the first setup step.,"['A61B34/30', 'G16H20/40']","['A61B', 'G16H']",37,1.0,US20230200889A1,"A61B18/12,A61B90/06,G16H40/00,A61M,A61B2018/00702,A61M1/71,A61N,A61N7/02,G05B19/0428,A61B18/1206,A61B2017/00398,G16,A61B2018/00648,A61B2017/07271,A61B2217/002,A61B2017/00734,A61B17/072,A61B2034/2046,G05B19/04,G05B,A61M1/78,A61B34/30,A61B17/07207,A61B34/37,A61B2017/00017,A61B2090/066,A61B17/068,A61B2017/07257,A61B2217/00,A61B2018/00595,A61B2018/00696,A61B18/1442,A61B18/04,A61B2218/008,A61B2017/00367,A61B2018/00636,A61B2018/00642,A61B2018/00773,G05B19/00,G05B19/02,A61B2017/00026,A61B2017/00199,A61B2218/007,G,A61B2017/2926,G16H40/60,A61B2018/00791,A61B90/37,A61B2217/005,A,A61B2034/2059,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B2017/32007,A61B2017/07285,A61B2017/320072,A61B2218/00,A61B2018/00589,A61B18/00,G05,A61B17/320068,A61B2218/001,A61M1/784,A61B2017/00022,A61B2017/2927,A61,A61B17/28,A61B2017/00084,A61B2017/00221,A61B2090/064,G05B19/042,A61B17/00,A61B2017/07214,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B18/1477,A61B34/35,A61N7/00,G16H40/63,A61B34/20,A61B2090/364,A61B2018/00601,A61M1/74,A61B2018/00571,A61B90/36,A61M1/00,A61B17/32,A61B90/00,A61B17/29,A61B2017/320074,A61B2018/0063,A61B2017/00681","Surgical systems can include evacuation systems for evacuating smoke, flui