US2021327577A1,System and method for monitoring patient state,"A patient state monitoring system and a method for monitoring patient state are disclosed. The patient state monitoring system includes a monitoring device and a monitoring module communicationally connected to the monitoring device, the monitoring module being worn on the patient&#39;s body. The patient state monitoring system also includes a processor that obtains parameters, and sets the operating mode of a monitoring module according to the obtained parameters, where the operating mode of the monitoring module comprises a continuous monitoring module and an intermittent monitoring mode. By use of the patient state monitoring system and method, during the monitoring of a patient, strict monitoring of the user&#39;s physical condition can be satisfied and the processing of redundant data can be reduced, thereby improving monitoring efficiency and quality.","['G16H40/40', 'G16H40/20']","['G16H', 'G16H']",32,1.0,US20230200889A1,"A61B18/12,A61B90/06,G16H40/00,A61M,A61B2018/00702,A61M1/71,A61N,A61N7/02,G05B19/0428,A61B18/1206,A61B2017/00398,G16,A61B2018/00648,A61B2017/07271,A61B2217/002,A61B2017/00734,A61B17/072,A61B2034/2046,G05B19/04,G05B,A61M1/78,A61B34/30,A61B17/07207,A61B34/37,A61B2017/00017,A61B2090/066,A61B17/068,A61B2017/07257,A61B2217/00,A61B2018/00595,A61B2018/00696,A61B18/1442,A61B18/04,A61B2218/008,A61B2017/00367,A61B2018/00636,A61B2018/00642,A61B2018/00773,G05B19/00,G05B19/02,A61B2017/00026,A61B2017/00199,A61B2218/007,G,A61B2017/2926,G16H40/60,A61B2018/00791,A61B90/37,A61B2217/005,A,A61B2034/2059,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B2017/32007,A61B2017/07285,A61B2017/320072,A61B2218/00,A61B2018/00589,A61B18/00,G05,A61B17/320068,A61B2218/001,A61M1/784,A61B2017/00022,A61B2017/2927,A61,A61B17/28,A61B2017/00084,A61B2017/00221,A61B2090/064,G05B19/042,A61B17/00,A61B2017/07214,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B18/1477,A61B34/35,A61N7/00,G16H40/63,A61B34/20,A61B2090/364,A61B2018/00601,A61M1/74,A61B2018/00571,A61B90/36,A61M1/00,A61B17