US2020259768A1,"Method, program, and information processing device","A predetermined user is supported behind the scenes with a variety of functions in order to promote messaging in a talk room in an instant messaging application. A method for messaging through a talk room is provided. This method includes the steps, executed by a virtual user implemented by a computer for assisting a first user, of dynamically generating a first message intended for the first user or a second user based on a history of messaging in the talk room and health information on the second user; providing the first message to the talk room in association with the first user; updating the history in response to the provision of the first message; and generating a first screen to be presented to the first user and a second screen to be presented to the second user, the first and second screens being associated with the talk room. The history is classified into a first group involved with the first user and the virtual user that perform the messaging, and a second group involved with the second user, and placed on each of the first screen and second screen over time.","['G16H10/60', 'H04L67/535']","['G16H', 'H04L']",38,1.0,US20230112134A1,"C12Q1/6813,G,C,C12Q1/00,G16B20/10,G16B30/00,C12Q,C12Q1/6827,C12Q1/68,G16B20/20,C12,G16B20/00,G16H,G16,G16H50/20,G16B,G16B40/00,G16B30/20,G16H50/00,G16B30/10","Provided herein are methods, processes and apparatuses for non-invasive assessment of genetic variations.",[38],"G16H,G16H50/20,G16H50/00",,12,8.0
