US2021390265A1,Natural-language medical record generation platform,"Systems and methods for generating a natural-language statement for a healthcare record are provided. A graphical user interface comprising a canvas region and a menu region is displayed, wherein menu region comprises a first set of one or more interactive graphical user interface menu objects configured to receive user inputs corresponding to medical information. Data is received representing a first user input comprising user interaction with one or more of the first set of menu objects, the first input indicating medical information for a patient. In accordance with the first user input, a natural-language statement is generated based on the medical information indicated by the first user input, and display of the canvas region is updated to display the natural-language statement.","['G06F3/0482', 'G16H10/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",40,1.0,US20230165642A1,"A61B18/12,A61B2017/2945,A61B2018/1246,A61B17/115,A61B2090/061,A61B90/06,A61B17/1222,A61B2090/365,G16H40/00,A61B2017/2943,A61B34/70,A61B2017/00464,A61B2017/00039,A61B2017/2941,A61B2017/00725,A61B18/1206,A61B2017/00398,A61B2034/107,G16,A61B2017/07271,A61B2217/002,A61B2090/366,A61B90/30,A61B17/04,A61B2017/00734,A61B17/072,A61B2034/2046,A61B17/3421,A61B2217/007,A61B34/30,A61B17/282,A61B17/07207,A61B17/02,A61B17/3417,A61B2090/0808,A61B34/37,A61B2017/00061,A61B2017/00115,A61B2017/00017,A61B90/94,A61B2017/00477,A61B2090/066,A61B17/068,A61B2017/00473,A61B2217/00,A61B2034/2055,A61B17/083,A61B2017/2939,A61B17/122,A61B17/0206,A61B18/04,A61B90/08,A61B2218/008,A61B2017/00367,A61B2018/1253,A61B2017/00743,A61B2017/00026,A61B2090/065,A61B2017/320094,A61B17/064,A61B2017/00199,A61B2218/007,G,A61B2017/2926,A61B2090/0807,A61B17/08,A61B17/105,A61B17/06,A61B2017/00057,A61B2090/0811,A61B17/320092,A61B17/1155,A61B2217/005,A,G16H,A61B17/34,A61B2017/320072,A61B17/062,A61B2218/00,A61B90/90,A61B18/00,A61B17/320068,A61B2218/001,A61B2017/00022,A61B90/98,A61B34/76,A61B2017/2927