US2014085077A1,Sedentary activity management method and apparatus using data from a data-capable band for managing health and wellness,"Data-capable personal worn or carried device can be used to detect sedentary activity for facilitating achievement of health and wellness goals. In one embodiment, a method includes receiving data representing an activity originating from a wearable device, determining the data representing the activity is a sedentary activity, and characterizing the sedentary activity based on a sedentary characteristic of the sedentary activity. Also, the method can initiate generation of notification alert information indicative of the presence of a value associated with the sedentary characteristic. In some embodiment, the method can cause a vibratory energy source in the wearable device to impart the notification alert information (e.g., haptically).","['G16H40/67', 'A61B5/681']","['G16H', 'A61B']",29,1.0,US20230075466A1,"G06F40/205,A61B2034/2048,G02B27/01,A61B2090/365,G16H40/00,G16H40/67,A61B5/316,A61B3/00,A61B5/117,G06F3/00,G06F16/23,G16,G06F21/00,G06F3/011,G06F21/60,G10,G16H20/40,G06F21/6218,G06F40/20,G06F40/00,G06F3/013,A61B2034/2046,G02B27/00,A61B5/0059,G02B27/0093,A61B5/1176,G06F3/012,A61B2017/00017,G16H30/40,A61B5/339,A61B5/06,G06F16/2379,G06F40/279,G10L,A61B5/318,A61B2017/00216,G06F16/22,G06F21/6245,G06V20/20,A61B5/0077,G16H30/00,G02B2027/0138,G06F21/32,G06F21/30,G02B27/0101,G02,G,G02B27/0172,G16H40/60,A61B3/10,A61B90/37,A61B5/48,A,G16H,A61B2090/502,G02B2027/0127,A61B5/1171,G02B2027/0141,G16H10/00,G06F16/00,G06F21/31,A61,G10L15/26,G10L15/00,G02B,G06F,A61B2017/00207,G06F3/017,A61B17/00,A61B5/24,G02B27/017,A61B5/4803,A61B,A61B34/00,A61B3/0041,A61B3/0016,G16H10/60,G06F16/20,G16H20/00,G16H40/63,A61B3/113,G06V,A61B34/20,A61B2090/364,G06F40/289,A61B90/36,G16H80/00,A61B5/00,A61B2090/372,G02B2027/014,G06F21/62,A61B90/00,G06V20/00,A61B90/50,G06F3/01,G06","A wearable device can present virtual content to the wearer for many applications in a heal