US2013303863A1,Patient Monitoring Apparatus,"A patient monitoring system including a sensing-recording device that attaches to a patient and a probe utilized by attending personnel at a trauma site. After an initial interaction between the probe and the sensing-recording device, the sensing-recording device samples one or more physiological parameters and stores time stamped readings in a first memory. The probe is adapted to take other measurements, download the data from the first memory of the sensing-recording device, manipulate the collective data and return data to a second memory in the sensing-recording device. The sensing-recording device continues to accumulate data in the first memory during transport of the patient from a trauma site to a medical facility.","['A61B5/00', 'G16H40/67']","['A61B', 'G16H']",34,1.0,US20230057206A1,"A61B5/4261,G08B,A61M2205/3306,A61B5/01,A61M16/16,A61B5/02055,G16H40/00,A61M2205/3303,A61M2205/50,A61M,H,A61B2562/0271,A47G9/02,A47G,G16H40/67,G05D23/00,A61B5/117,A47C,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6887,G05B2219/26,G05B19/0428,A61M2230/42,G16,A61M2205/3592,A61B2562/063,A61M2021/0083,A61M2230/50,A61M2021/0022,A61M2230/40,A61M2205/00,G05B19/04,G05B2219/20,G05B,A61M16/10,A47,A61M2205/33,H05B1/02,A47C21/04,A61M2230/04,H05B1/0227,A47C21/042,A61M2205/02,A61M2205/3673,A47C31/00,A61M2205/502,A61B5/024,A61B5/0015,A61M2205/0294,A61B2560/00,G05B2219/2614,H05B1/00,A61M2230/00,A61M2205/505,A61B5/0816,A61B2560/02,A61M21/00,A61M16/14,G08B6/00,G05B19/00,A61B5/0205,A61M16/161,G05B19/02,A61M2021/0005,A61M2205/35,A61B2562/00,A47G9/0238,A61M21/02,H05B1/0252,G,A61B2560/0242,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B2505/07,A47C31/12,A61M2230/06,H05B,A61B5/6892,H05B1/0272,A61B2562/06,A61B5/48,A,A61B5/4266,G16H,A61M2205/3584,A61B5/74,A47C21/00,G05,A61B2560/04,A61B5/7455,A61B5/11,A47C21/048,A61,A61M2205/0272,G08,G05D23/01,A61M2230/63,A61M16/00,G05B19/042,G05D,A61M2205/18,A61B,A61M2205/3375,A61B5/42,A47G9/00,A61M2021/0066,A61B5/02,A61B2560/0475,A61B5/103,G05B2219/00,A61B5/08,A47C31/123,G0