US2019131014A1,"Process, control unit, computer program product as well as system for providing failure safety for a medical monitoring procedure","A process for providing failure safety for a patient data (41) medical monitoring procedure (40). The medical monitoring procedure (40) is carried out by a standard computer (10), wherein the patient data (41) are sent, furthermore, to the standard computer (10) and are compared with threshold values there. A control device (20), to a computer program product (30) practicing the method as well as to a system (1) for providing failure safety for a medical monitoring procedure (40) of patient data (41) are also provided, wherein the medical monitoring procedure (40) is carried out by a standard computer (10).","['G16H80/00', 'G16H10/60']","['G16H', 'G16H']",41,1.0,US20230057206A1,"A61B5/4261,G08B,A61M2205/3306,A61B5/01,A61M16/16,A61B5/02055,G16H40/00,A61M2205/3303,A61M2205/50,A61M,H,A61B2562/0271,A47G9/02,A47G,G16H40/67,G05D23/00,A61B5/117,A47C,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6887,G05B2219/26,G05B19/0428,A61M2230/42,G16,A61M2205/3592,A61B2562/063,A61M2021/0083,A61M2230/50,A61M2021/0022,A61M2230/40,A61M2205/00,G05B19/04,G05B2219/20,G05B,A61M16/10,A47,A61M2205/33,H05B1/02,A47C21/04,A61M2230/04,H05B1/0227,A47C21/042,A61M2205/02,A61M2205/3673,A47C31/00,A61M2205/502,A61B5/024,A61B5/0015,A61M2205/0294,A61B2560/00,G05B2219/2614,H05B1/00,A61M2230/00,A61M2205/505,A61B5/0816,A61B2560/02,A61M21/00,A61M16/14,G08B6/00,G05B19/00,A61B5/0205,A61M16/161,G05B19/02,A61M2021/0005,A61M2205/35,A61B2562/00,A47G9/0238,A61M21/02,H05B1/0252,G,A61B2560/0242,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B2505/07,A47C31/12,A61M2230/06,H05B,A61B5/6892,H05B1/0272,A61B2562/06,A61B5/48,A,A61B5/4266,G16H,A61M2205/3584,A61B5/74,A47C21/00,G05,A61B2560/04,A61B5/7455,A61B5/11,A47C21/048,A61,A61M2205/0272,G08,G05D23/01,A61M2230/63,A61M16/00,G05B19/042,G05D,A61M2205/18,A61B,A61M2205/3375,A61B5/42,A47G9/00,A61M2021/0066,A61B5/02,A61B2560/0475,A61B5/103,G05B2219/00,A61B5/08,A47C31/123,G05D23/13,A61M220