US2021327577A1,System and method for monitoring patient state,"A patient state monitoring system and a method for monitoring patient state are disclosed. The patient state monitoring system includes a monitoring device and a monitoring module communicationally connected to the monitoring device, the monitoring module being worn on the patient&#39;s body. The patient state monitoring system also includes a processor that obtains parameters, and sets the operating mode of a monitoring module according to the obtained parameters, where the operating mode of the monitoring module comprises a continuous monitoring module and an intermittent monitoring mode. By use of the patient state monitoring system and method, during the monitoring of a patient, strict monitoring of the user&#39;s physical condition can be satisfied and the processing of redundant data can be reduced, thereby improving monitoring efficiency and quality.","['G16H40/40', 'G16H40/20']","['G16H', 'G16H']",32,1.0,US20230057206A1,"A61B5/4261,G08B,A61M2205/3306,A61B5/01,A61M16/16,A61B5/02055,G16H40/00,A61M2205/3303,A61M2205/50,A61M,H,A61B2562/0271,A47G9/02,A47G,G16H40/67,G05D23/00,A61B5/117,A47C,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6887,G05B2219/26,G05B19/0428,A61M2230/42,G16,A61M2205/3592,A61B2562/063,A61M2021/0083,A61M2230/50,A61M2021/0022,A61M2230/40,A61M2205/00,G05B19/04,G05B2219/20,G05B,A61M16/10,A47,A61M2205/33,H05B1/02,A47C21/04,A61M2230/04,H05B1/0227,A47C21/042,A61M2205/02,A61M2205/3673,A47C31/00,A61M2205/502,A61B5/024,A61B5/0015,A61M2205/0294,A61B2560/00,G05B2219/2614,H05B1/00,A61M2230/00,A61M2205/505,A61B5/0816,A61B2560/02,A61M21/00,A61M16/14,G08B6/00,G05B19/00,A61B5/0205,A61M16/161,G05B19/02,A61M2021/0005,A61M2205/35,A61B2562/00,A47G9/0238,A61M21/02,H05B1/0252,G,A61B2560/0242,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,A61B2505/07,A47C31/12,A61M2230/06,H05B,A61B5/6892,H05B1/0272,A61B2562/06,A61B5/48,A,A61B5/4266,G16H,A61M2205/3584,A61B5/74,A47C21/00,G05,A61B2560/04,A61B5/7455,A61B5/11,A47C21/048,A61,A61M2205/0272,G08,G05D23/01,A61M2230/63,A