US2009131746A1,Capsule endoscope system and method of processing image data thereof,"The present invention relates to a capsule endoscope system and method of processing image data thereof and is suitable for capturing the inner parts of human body using a capsule endoscope having an internally-usable capsule size and receiving to display image data generated from the capturing. By the present invention, a possible-disease part of a patient is selected and observed through a number of image data received from a capsule endoscope, attribute information containing diagnostic details are supported to facilitate an overall diagnostic result to be interpreted, and internal organs in numerous image data received from a capsule endoscope are easily discriminated from each other.","['G16H30/40', 'A61B1/04']","['G16H', 'A61B']",27,1.0,US20230118508A1,"H04L63/02,A61B5/02405,H04W12/35,A61B5/4815,G16H40/00,A61B5/02055,H04L67/00,A61B5/1112,H,G16H40/67,G06F17/00,A61B5/6813,H04L63/00,G16Z,A61B5/0002,A61B5/6824,A61B5/6801,G16,A61B5/22,A61B5/683,A61B5/1118,H04L,H04L67/50,G01P,G06M3/00,G01P15/00,H04W12/00,H04L63/04,A61B5/681,G06M,G11,H04L67/535,A61B2560/0204,H04W76/00,H04L63/0471,G11B27/105,G16H20/30,G11B27/00,G11B,G16Z99/00,G01C22/00,A61B5/024,A61B5/0015,A61B2560/0214,A61B2560/00,H04W76/14,A61B2560/0271,G01C5/00,A61B2560/02,A61B5/0205,H04L63/0281,A61B2562/00,A61B5/6829,G01,G,A61B2560/0242,G01D21/00,H04L63/0464,A61B5/68,A61B5/221,G16H40/60,H04W12/02,A61B5/48,A,G16H,G01D,A61B5/222,G01C22/006,G01D21/02,A61B5/0024,G08C17/00,H04W12/50,A61B5/11,A61,G08,G06F,H04W12/30,H04,A61B2560/0266,G08C,G08C17/02,G11B27/10,G11B27/102,A61B,H04W76/10,A61B5/6802,A61B2562/0219,A61B5/02,G16H20/00,A61B5/103,G16H40/63,H04L63/0428,A61B5/4806,A61B5/4812,A61B5/00,A61B5/6838,G01C,H04W,A61B2562/02,G06F17/40,A61B5/0022,G06","The present inventions, in one aspect, are directed to systems and circuitry for and/or methods of establishing communication having one or more pairing facilitator-intermediary devices (for ex