US2010256993A1,Method And System For Defining And Interactively Managing A Watched Diet,"A method for interactive defining and managing of a controlled diet, prescribed to a patient by a doctor/dietician or another operator authorized to such function, includes the asynchronous execution of at least two different operational cycles. A first operational cycle is effected through an interactive terminal, for example a mobile phone, with which the above mentioned patient is equipped substantially for each meal consumed by the patient. The interactive terminal runs a program, which is started on patient&#39;s command, and which operates on the basis of dietary order made by the doctor/dietician for the patient. The first operational cycle includes a step, in which the foods to be consumed in a given meal are chosen from a fist food data base, a step of quantification of the chosen food and a step of assessment of the congruity of the choices made by the patient with what is prescribed by the order. The first operational cycle includes also a step, during which data related to the quantities and to the composition of the food chosen by the patient are put at the disposal on the data transmission line. A second operational cycle executed by the doctor/dietician on a central processing unit,","['G06F19/00', 'G16H20/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",7,1.0,US20230074617A1,"A61,A61B5/150007,A61B2562/0295,A61B5/14,G,A61B5/14532,A61B5/14546,A61B5/15103,G16H40/00,G16H40/60,A61B5/150854,Y02A,A61B5/15101,A61B5/157,A61B5/746,A61B,A61B5/150969,G16H40/67,A61B5/151,A61B5/1486,A61B5/15105,A61B5/0004,A61B5/0002,A61B5/14735,Y,A61B5/742,A,A61B5/150015,G16H,Y02,A61B5/1427,A61B5/15,A61B5/150358,G16,Y02A90/00,A61B5/0015,A61B5/14865,A61B5/1495,Y02A90/10,A61B5/1405,A61B5/150267,A61B5/150022,A61B5/7282,A61B5/72,A61B5/1468,A61B5/15087,A61B5/150847,A61B5/00,A61B5/145,A61B5/150877,A61B5/155,A61B5/74,A61B5/1411,A61B5/150206,A61B5/0024,A61B5/1473,A61B5/7271,A61B2562/02,A61B5/150862,A61B5/0022,A61B2562/00","A