US2018085165A1,Method and computer program product for preplanning orthopedic surgery,"A method of preplanning orthopedic surgery and computer program therefore. The method includes the steps of: importing an x-ray image into an electronic canvas; scaling the x-ray image to determine the pixel to distance ratio; creating on the canvas one or more moveable, rotatable trace overlays of bones or bone fragments visible in the x-ray; inserting onto the canvas one or more moveable, rotatable images of orthopedic implants; and rotating and moving the trace overlays and the images of orthopedic implants into positions depicting the planned surgical outcome.","['G16H30/40', 'G16H30/40']","['G16H', 'G16H']",33,1.0,US20230050272A1,"A61B1/00004,G06T7/00,A61B5/0082,A61B5/064,G06T7/251,G16,G06T7/0002,G06K9/00,A61P31/00,A61B5/0059,G06V20/60,G06T2207/00,G01J3/00,A61B5/0088,A61B5/45,A61B1/32,A61B1/00002,A61C9/0053,A61B5/4547,G16H30/40,A61B5/06,A61C19/063,A61B5/4542,A61C2007/004,A61C9/0046,G06V10/70,G06T2207/30036,G06V2201/03,G16H30/00,G06T7/70,G06V10/74,A61C19/066,A61C11/00,G01,G,G06T7/0014,A61B5/061,G06T7/246,G06T2207/30004,G06T7/30,G06V10/00,G01J3/52,G06T2207/30,A61B5/742,A,G16H,A61C9/004,A61B5/4538,G06F18/00,G06T7/0012,A61P31/10,A61B1/000094,G06T7/73,A61C19/10,G01J3/508,A61B5/74,A61C,G01J3/46,G06V20/64,G06T7/33,A61B1/00009,A61C9/00,A61,G06V10/751,A61C19/06,G06V20/653,G01J3/50,A61C7/002,G06F,A61B1/00,A61C7/00,G06T7/50,A61B,G01J,G06V10/75,G06T,G06V,A61B1/000095,G06V2201/00,G06T7/20,A61P,A61B5/00,G06V20/00,A61C19/00,G06T7/55,A61B2576/02,G06,A61B2576/00","A method for acquiring at least one two-dimensional image of a part of arches of a patient includes steps carried out by the patient or other person who is not a dental health professional, for example, including placing a dental separator in the mouth of the patient in order to separate the lips of the patient and improve the visibility of the teeth during the acquisition of said at least one two-dimensional image, and acquiring, i