US2021358625A1,Methods and apparatus for presenting alternative hypotheses for medical facts,"Techniques for presenting alternative hypotheses for medical facts may include identifying, using at least one statistical fact extraction model, a plurality of alternative hypotheses for a medical fact to be extracted from a portion of text documenting a patient encounter. At least two of the alternative hypotheses may be selected, and the selected hypotheses may be presented to a user documenting the patient encounter.","['G16H50/20', 'G10L15/26']","['G16H', 'G10L']",10,1.0,US20230050272A1,"A61B1/00004,G06T7/00,A61B5/0082,A61B5/064,G06T7/251,G16,G06T7/0002,G06K9/00,A61P31/00,A61B5/0059,G06V20/60,G06T2207/00,G01J3/00,A61B5/0088,A61B5/45,A61B1/32,A61B1/00002,A61C9/0053,A61B5/4547,G16H30/40,A61B5/06,A61C19/063,A61B5/4542,A61C2007/004,A61C9/0046,G06V10/70,G06T2207/30036,G06V2201/03,G16H30/00,G06T7/70,G06V10/74,A61C19/066,A61C11/00,G01,G,G06T7/0014,A61B5/061,G06T7/246,G06T2207/30004,G06T7/30,G06V10/00,G01J3/52,G06T2207/30,A61B5/742,A,G16H,A61C9/004,A61B5/4538,G06F18/00,G06T7/0012,A61P31/10,A61B1/000094,G06T7/73,A61C19/10,G01J3/508,A61B5/74,A61C,G01J3/46,G06V20/64,G06T7/33,A61B1/00009,A61C9/00,A61,G06V10/751,A61C19/06,G06V20/653,G01J3/50,A61C7/002,G06F,A61B1/00,A61C7/00,G06T7/50,A61B,G01J,G06V10/75,G06T,G06V,A61B1/000095,G06V2201/00,G06T7/20,A61P,A61B5/00,G06V20/00,A61C19/00,G06T7/55,A61B2576/02,G06,A61B2576/00","A method for acquiring at least one two-dimensional image of a part of arches of a patient includes steps carried out by the patient or other person who is not a dental health professional, for example, including placing a dental separator in the mouth of the patient in order to separate the lips of the patient and improve the visibility of the teeth during the acquisition of said at least one two-dimensional image, and acquiring, in a mouth closed position and with a personal image acquisition apparatus, said at least one two-dimensional image.",[10],"G16H30/40,G16H30