US2022257320A1,"Systems, devices, and methods for tool skive avoidance","A system for skive avoidance includes a sensor configured to measure a force exerted on a surgical tool; at least one processor; and a memory. The memory stores instructions for execution by the at least one processor that, when executed, cause the at least one processor to: project a tool trajectory onto a three-dimensional (3D) model of bone tissue; and estimate an expected normal force direction and magnitude upon contact of the surgical tool with the bone tissue.","['A61B90/00', 'G16H20/40']","['A61B', 'G16H']",37,1.0,US20230116571A1,"A61B18/12,A61B2018/1246,A61B2018/00541,A61B17/115,A61N1/0404,A61B2090/061,A61B90/06,A61B2018/00875,A61N1/00,G16H40/00,A61B2017/00225,A61B2017/0042,A61B2017/00044,A61N1/04,A61B34/70,A61B2017/00464,A61B2017/00039,A61B2017/00818,A61B34/77,A61N,A61B2018/00607,A61B18/1206,A61B2017/00398,G16,A61B2017/07271,G16H20/40,A61B2217/002,A61B90/30,A61B2090/3975,A61B17/072,A61B2218/002,A61B2034/2046,A61B2217/007,A61B34/30,A61N1/327,A61B17/07207,A61B2034/302,A61B2018/00994,A61B2090/0808,A61B34/37,A61B2017/00115,A61B2017/00017,G16H20/30,A61B2017/00442,A61B2017/00477,A61B2090/066,A61B17/068,A61B2017/07257,A61B2018/00595,A61B2217/00,A61B2090/397,A61N1/18,A61B18/1442,A61B2017/07278,A61B18/04,A61B90/08,A61B2218/008,A61B2017/00367,A61B2018/00636,A61B2018/00642,A61B2017/00123,A61N1/0408,A61B2018/00773,A61B2018/1273,A61B2017/00743,A61B2017/00026,A61B90/361,A61B2017/00199,A61B2218/007,A61B2017/00389,G,A61B90/39,A61B2017/2926,G16H40/60,A61B2090/0807,A61N1/32,A61B2090/0811,A61B90/37,A61B2018/00982,A61B17/320092,A61B17/1155,A61B2217/005,A,A61B2034/2059,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B2017/07285,A61B2017/320072,A61B2017/320093,A61B2218/00,A61B90/90,A61B18/00,A61B2034/304,A61N1/02,A61B17/320068,A61B2218/001,A61B1/04,A61B2017/00022,A61B2017/00393,A61B34/76,A61B2017/2927,A61B2018/00892,A61B17/11,A61,A61B2017/00084,A61B17/28,A61B90/53,A61B2034/305,A61B2018/126,A61B2017/00221,A61B2090/064,A61B2090/3937,A61B