US2013303863A1,Patient Monitoring Apparatus,"A patient monitoring system including a sensing-recording device that attaches to a patient and a probe utilized by attending personnel at a trauma site. After an initial interaction between the probe and the sensing-recording device, the sensing-recording device samples one or more physiological parameters and stores time stamped readings in a first memory. The probe is adapted to take other measurements, download the data from the first memory of the sensing-recording device, manipulate the collective data and return data to a second memory in the sensing-recording device. The sensing-recording device continues to accumulate data in the first memory during transport of the patient from a trauma site to a medical facility.","['A61B5/00', 'G16H40/67']","['A61B', 'G16H']",34,1.0,US20230116571A1,"A61B18/12,A61B2018/1246,A61B2018/00541,A61B17/115,A61N1/0404,A61B2090/061,A61B90/06,A61B2018/00875,A61N1/00,G16H40/00,A61B2017/00225,A61B2017/0042,A61B2017/00044,A61N1/04,A61B34/70,A61B2017/00464,A61B2017/00039,A61B2017/00818,A61B34/77,A61N,A61B2018/00607,A61B18/1206,A61B2017/00398,G16,A61B2017/07271,G16H20/40,A61B2217/002,A61B90/30,A61B2090/3975,A61B17/072,A61B2218/002,A61B2034/2046,A61B2217/007,A61B34/30,A61N1/327,A61B17/07207,A61B2034/302,A61B2018/00994,A61B2090/0808,A61B34/37,A61B2017/00115,A61B2017/00017,G16H20/30,A61B2017/00442,A61B2017/00477,A61B2090/066,A61B17/068,A61B2017/07257,A61B2018/00595,A61B2217/00,A61B2090/397,A61N1/18,A61B18/1442,A61B2017/07278,A61B18/04,A61B90/08,A61B2218/008,A61B2017/00367,A61B2018/00636,A61B2018/00642,A61B2017/00123,A61N1/0408,A61B2018/00773,A61B2018/1273,A61B2017/00743,A61B2017/00026,A61B90/361,A61B2017/00199,A61B2218/007,A61B2017/00389,G,A61B90/39,A61B2017/2926,G16H40/60,A61B2090/0807,A61N1/32,A61B2090/0811,A61B90/37,A61B2018/00982,A61B17/320092,A61B17/1155,A61B2217/005,A,A61B2034/2059,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B2017/07285,A61B2017/320072,A61B2017/320093,A61B2218/00,A61B90/90,A61B18/00,A61B2034/304,A6