US2013303863A1,Patient Monitoring Apparatus,"A patient monitoring system including a sensing-recording device that attaches to a patient and a probe utilized by attending personnel at a trauma site. After an initial interaction between the probe and the sensing-recording device, the sensing-recording device samples one or more physiological parameters and stores time stamped readings in a first memory. The probe is adapted to take other measurements, download the data from the first memory of the sensing-recording device, manipulate the collective data and return data to a second memory in the sensing-recording device. The sensing-recording device continues to accumulate data in the first memory during transport of the patient from a trauma site to a medical facility.","['A61B5/00', 'G16H40/67']","['A61B', 'G16H']",34,1.0,US20230079256A1,"A63B2244/00,H04N23/00,A42B3/0433,B33Y10/00,G06K19/07758,A61B5/6806,A63B2243/0066,A63B43/00,G09B19/00,A61B5/01,G16H40/00,A63B21/0726,A61B5/05,A63B69/0002,H04L67/00,A63B71/12,H,A63B2244/102,A63B21/00,A63B69/38,G09B19/0038,A63B71/085,A63B2220/20,A63B2071/1283,G16H40/67,A61B5/316,A63B71/1225,A63B71/1216,A42B3/00,G01L,A42B3/04,A42B3/0406,G06K19/02,G09,A63B71/00,G06F3/00,A61B5/0002,A63B69/06,A61B5/6801,A61B5/6887,A63B2071/1233,A63B71/145,A61B5/055,G16,A63B2230/50,A63F13/20,A63B2243/0095,A42B3/046,A63B2220/806,A63B2243/0054,A63B2220/803,A63B2220/56,H04B,A63B2220/50,H04L,A63B2244/20,A63B2220/13,G06Q,G01L5/0052,A63B69/02,A63B2230/00,A63B60/00,A63B2220/51,A63B2220/10,A61B5/053,A63B71/06,G16H20/30,A63B2225/30,A63B2220/74,H04W4/00,A63B2243/007,A63B2220/24,G06V40/00,H04Q2209/00,A42,A63B2225/74,A63B2220/12,A61B5/024,G06K19/067,A63B24/0003,A63B69/0026,A61B5/0015,H04B1/04,A63B69/0048,H04N7/18,A63F13/211,A61B5/318,A63B,G06V20/20,G06Q40/00,G16H30/00,A63B2243/0025,G06K19/06,A63B2230/04,H04Q,A61B5/6895,A63B69/16,A63B2220/75,A63B2220/40,A63B2244/19,A61B5/0533,G16H50/00,A61B2562/00,H04W4/38,A63B2220/836,A63F,A63B60/46,A63B43/004,H04N5/2253,G09B19/003,A6