US2010179835A1,Relating multiple electronic health records,"A computer-implemented method for alerting one or more members of a connected health network is provided, wherein the connected health network includes two or more members having linked medical records. The method includes receiving a change in a first health record of a first member, the first health record being linked to a second health record of a second member based on a specified relationship. The method also includes using the change in the first health record to determine whether a condition exists that could affect the second member, and, if so, alerting the second member of the affect of the change in the first health record on the second member.","['G06Q50/00', 'G16H10/60']","['G06Q', 'G16H']",29,1.0,US20230027213A1,"H04N23/00,G08B,G16H40/00,G01S19/39,H,H04N21/21,G08B13/196,H04N5/28,H04N23/66,G16H40/67,G08B13/18,G08B13/19682,H04N21/218,H04N7/185,G01S19/14,G16,G08B13/19684,H04W80/00,H04N21/00,H04N23/617,H04N21/238,H04N21/2662,G08B13/19641,H04N5/23206,G01S19/00,G01S,H04N21/23,H04N21/462,H04N23/51,H04N21/266,G08B13/19678,H04N7/18,H04N21/234,H04N5/222,G08B13/19654,H04N5/2251,G01S19/38,H04N21/4621,G08B13/19639,H04N21/25808,H04N7/183,H04N21/258,G01,G,G08B13/1966,G16H40/60,H04N7/00,H04N5/23225,H04N21/234363,H04N5/2254,H04N21/25,G08B13/00,H04N5/23203,G16H,G08B13/189,H04N21/25825,G01S19/19,H04N21/45,G08C17/00,G08C2201/93,H04N23/50,H04N5/00,G01S19/13,H04N23/661,G08C2201/00,H04N23/55,H04N7/181,G08,G01S19/01,H04N,H04,H04N23/60,G08C,G08C17/02,H04N21/2385,H04N21/2343,G01S19/42,H04W80/02,H04N21/20,H04N21/2365,H04N21/40,G08B13/194,G08C2201/90,H04N21/21805,H04N5/76,H04W,H04N21/236",A wearable digital video camera (10) is equipped with wireless connection protocol and global navigation and location positioning system technology to provide remote image acquisition control and viewing. The Bluetooth® packet-based open wireless technology standard protocol (400) is preferred for use in providing control signals or st