US2020194106A1,System and device for non-invasive detection of input and output events,"Wearable device has at least one sensor operable to detect motion of the wearable device and a biological sensor coupled to the processor and operable to detect a biological indicator of the user. Wearable is operable to obtain at least one biological indicator of the user and correlate the biological indicator of the user with the detected motion in time. Wearable is also able to determine one or more input events based on one or more of the at least one biological indicator or detected motion, each input event including an input activity and input duration and create an input log for every determined one or more inputs events, wherein the input log includes an entry for each corresponding input event that includes at least one of the input activity, input duration, and input time. In at least one example, the wearable determines a net balance of the user.","['G16H40/67', 'G16H20/30']","['G16H', 'G16H']",44,1.0,US20230153890A1,"A61,G,G06Q30/0255,G06Q30/02,G06Q30/0251,G16H20/30,A61B,G06Q30/0601,G06Q,G16H20/00,G06Q30/06,A,A61B5/103,G06Q30/0241,G16H,G16,A61B5/112,A61B5/00,G06Q30/00,G06Q30/0631,G06,A61B5/11","A retail enhancement system is disclosed. The retail enhancement system may include a sensor module configured to obtain a data about an individual during an athletic activity. The sensor module may be configured to be removably attached to a first article of footwear to be worn by the individual during the athletic activity. The retail enhancement system may also include an electronic device that is separate from the sensor module. The electronic device may be a dedicated device in a retail environment and may be configured to collect personal information about the individual, associate the sensor module with the individual, receive the data about the individual from the sensor module, determine a characteristic about a gait of the individual based on the data about the individual, and provide a recommendation about a second article of footwear to be worn by the individual to the individual.",[44],"G16H20/30,G16H20/00,G16H",G16H20/30,10,1.0
