US2021183494A1,An apparatus and method for personalized meal plan generation,"There is provided a computer-implemented method for generating a personalized meal plan for a subject. The method comprises acquiring ( 202 ) data associated with the subject, generating ( 204 ) a target nutrient value for the subject for a nutrient type based on the acquired data and selecting ( 206 ) a plurality of recommended food ingredients based on the generated value, generating ( 208 ) a meal plan by selecting a recipe based on the plurality of selected recommended food ingredients, determining ( 210 ) a difference between a provided amount of the nutrient type by the selected recipe and the generated target nutrient value for the nutrient type, and adjusting ( 212 ) the meal plan based on the determined difference.","['G16H10/60', 'G16H10/60']","['G16H', 'G16H']",9,1.0,US20230153890A1,"A61,G,G06Q30/0255,G06Q30/02,G06Q30/0251,G16H20/30,A61B,G06Q30/0601,G06Q,G16H20/00,G06Q30/06,A,A61B5/103,G06Q30/0241,G16H,G16,A61B5/112,A61B5/00,G06Q30/00,G06Q30/0631,G06,A61B5/11","A retail enhancement system is disclosed. The retail enhancement system may include a sensor module configured to obtain a data about an individual during an athletic activity. The sensor module may be configured to be removably attached to a first article of footwear to be worn by the individual during the athletic activity. The retail enhancement system may also include an electronic device that is separate from the sensor module. The electronic device may be a dedicated device in a retail environment and may be configured to collect personal information about the individual, associate the sensor module with the individual, receive the data about the individual from the sensor module, determine a characteristic about a gait of the individual based on the data about the individual, and provide a recommendation about a second article of footwear to be worn by the individual to the individual.",[9],"G16H20/30,G16H20/00,G16