US2021241880A1,Method for the determination of processing influences on the energy value of feedstuff raw materials and/or feedstuffs,"A computer-implemented methods for the determination and/or assessment of processing influences on the energy value of a feedstuff raw material and/or feedstuff, in which the processing conditions indicator of the feedstuff raw material and/or feedstuff is determined and the corrected energy values of the feedstuff raw material and/or feedstuff is determined. A process for the preparation of a feed considering the determined processing influences and the energy values of feedstuff raw materials and/or feedstuffs.","['G16H20/60', 'G16H20/60']","['G16H', 'G16H']",9,1.0,US20230153890A1,"A61,G,G06Q30/0255,G06Q30/02,G06Q30/0251,G16H20/30,A61B,G06Q30/0601,G06Q,G16H20/00,G06Q30/06,A,A61B5/103,G06Q30/0241,G16H,G16,A61B5/112,A61B5/00,G06Q30/00,G06Q30/0631,G06,A61B5/11","A retail enhancement system is disclosed. The retail enhancement system may include a sensor module configured to obtain a data about an individual during an athletic activity. The sensor module may be configured to be removably attached to a first article of footwear to be worn by the individual during the athletic activity. The retail enhancement system may also include an electronic device that is separate from the sensor module. The electronic device may be a dedicated device in a retail environment and may be configured to collect personal information about the individual, associate the sensor module with the individual, receive the data about the individual from the sensor module, determine a characteristic about a gait of the individual based on the data about the individual, and provide a recommendation about a second article of footwear to be worn by the individual to the individual.",[9],"G16H20/30,G16H20/00,G16H",,10,1.0
