US2010256993A1,Method And System For Defining And Interactively Managing A Watched Diet,"A method for interactive defining and managing of a controlled diet, prescribed to a patient by a doctor/dietician or another operator authorized to such function, includes the asynchronous execution of at least two different operational cycles. A first operational cycle is effected through an interactive terminal, for example a mobile phone, with which the above mentioned patient is equipped substantially for each meal consumed by the patient. The interactive terminal runs a program, which is started on patient&#39;s command, and which operates on the basis of dietary order made by the doctor/dietician for the patient. The first operational cycle includes a step, in which the foods to be consumed in a given meal are chosen from a fist food data base, a step of quantification of the chosen food and a step of assessment of the congruity of the choices made by the patient with what is prescribed by the order. The first operational cycle includes also a step, during which data related to the quantities and to the composition of the food chosen by the patient are put at the disposal on the data transmission line. A second operational cycle executed by the doctor/dietician on a central processing unit,","['G06F19/00', 'G16H20/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",7,1.0,US20230013632A1,"A61M2205/582,G08B,A61B5/16,G16H40/00,A61M2205/50,A61B5/1112,A61M,H,H04M1/72409,A61M2205/82,Y02A,G16H40/67,A61B5/165,A61M2205/8206,A61M2205/581,A61B5/0002,G08B21/04,G16,A61M5/168,H04M1/72412,A61J7/04,A61M5/172,A61M2205/00,G08B21/02,A61B5/14507,A61J7/0409,A61J7/0418,G06N5/00,H04M,A61M5/14,A61M2205/52,A61B5/746,G08B21/00,G06N5/043,A61J,A61M2205/502,A61M2205/58,A61B5/024,H04M1/72403,A61B5/0015,Y02A90/10,H04M1/00,A61M2230/00,A61B5/145,G16H50/00,A61M2205/35,Y,G16H20/17,G,A61B5/14532,G16H40/60,H04M1/72,A61B5/14517,A61J7/00,A61B5/48,A61B5/742,A,A61M2230/201,G16H,G16H20/10,A61B5/4866,A61M2230/20,Y02A90/00,G16H50/20,G08B21/0