US2020113436A1,"Physiological information transmission system, physiological information detection sensor, information processing apparatus, and physiological information transmission method","A physiological information transmission method includes: by an information processing apparatus: acquiring sensor identification information of a physiological information detection sensor which is adapted to be attached to a living body, and living body identification information of the living body; and transmitting first association information associating the acquired sensor identification information and the acquired living body identification information, with each other; and by the physiological information detection sensor: receiving the first association information; determining whether or not the received first association information contains sensor identification information of the own sensor; and when the received first association information contains the sensor identification information of the own sensor, transmitting second association information associating the living body identification information in the received first association information, and physiological information which is detected by the physiological information detection sensor, with each other, to an outside of the own sensor.","['G16H40/67', 'A61B5/0006']","['G16H', 'A61B']",36,1.0,US20230013632A1,"A61M2205/582,G08B,A61B5/16,G16H40/00,A61M2205/50,A61B5/1112,A61M,H,H04M1/72409,A61M2205/82,Y02A,G16H40/67,A61B5/165,A61M2205/8206,A61M2205/581,A61B5/0002,G08B21/04,G16,A61M5/168,H04M1/72412,A61J7/04,A61M5/172,A61M2205/00,G08B21/02,A61B5/14507,A61J7/0409,A61J7/0418,G06N5/00,H04M,A61M5/14,A61M2205/52,A61B5/746,G08B21/00,G06N5/043,A61J,A61M2205/502,A61M2205/58,A61B5/024,H04M1/72403,A61B5/0015,Y02A90/10,H04M1/00,A61M2230/00,A61B5/145,G16H50/00,A61M2205/35,Y,G16H20/17,G,A61B5/14532,G16H40/60,H04M1/72,A61B5/14517,A61J7/00,A61B5/48,A61B5/742,A,A61M2230/201,G16H,G16H20/10,A61B5/4866,A61M2230/20,Y02A90/00,G