US2021390265A1,Natural-language medical record generation platform,"Systems and methods for generating a natural-language statement for a healthcare record are provided. A graphical user interface comprising a canvas region and a menu region is displayed, wherein menu region comprises a first set of one or more interactive graphical user interface menu objects configured to receive user inputs corresponding to medical information. Data is received representing a first user input comprising user interaction with one or more of the first set of menu objects, the first input indicating medical information for a patient. In accordance with the first user input, a natural-language statement is generated based on the medical information indicated by the first user input, and display of the canvas region is updated to display the natural-language statement.","['G06F3/0482', 'G16H10/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",40,1.0,US20230019760A1,"A61M2205/276,G21G,A61B6/037,A61M2205/50,A61M,A61N5/00,A61N5/10,A61B6/481,A61M5/1407,G01T1/20,A61N,G16Z,A61N5/1048,A61M2205/75,B62B,G16,A61M5/168,G06F21/00,B62,A61N5/1075,A61M5/007,A61M5/172,A61M2205/00,A61B6/48,G21,A61M5/16877,A61M2205/33,A61M2005/1401,A61M5/145,A61G12/00,G21G4/08,A61B2090/392,A61M5/14,A61M2205/52,G21F7/00,A61M2205/051,A61N2005/1019,A61M2205/60,A61M2205/70,G21G1/00,A61N2005/1021,A61M2205/502,G16Z99/00,G01T,A61M2205/58,A61K,A61M2205/05,A61M5/16831,G21G4/04,A61B6/10,A61N2005/1094,A61M2205/505,G06F21/30,A61M5/16854,G21F,A61N5/1001,A61B6/03,G16H20/17,G01,B,G,A61B90/39,G21G4/00,A61M5/16827,G21G4/06,B62B3/005,A61M2205/6072,B62B3/00,A61M2209/084,A61B50/10,A61M2205/584,A,G16H,G16H20/10,A61M2205/587,A61G,A61K51/00,A61M5/16881,A61N5/1007,A61B50/00,A61B6/00,A61N2005/1074,A61B6/50,A61M5/365,A61M5/158,G06F21/31,A61B50/13,A61M2209/00,A61M5/142,A61M2205/6009,A61,A61M2209/08,B62B3/002,A61M2205/583,G06F,A61M2205/6054,A61M2205/18,G01T1/203,A61N2005/1092,A61B,A61M5/36,A61M2205/3375,A61B6/02,A61M2005/1403,A61M5/1409,G16H20/00,G21F3/00,A61G12/001,A61M