US2011030034A1,Urgent access medication dispensing station,"A medical supply station is disclosed. The medical supply station includes a securable compartment configured to hold medical supplies, and a controller. The controller is responsive to access information and is configured to selectively permit access to the securable compartment when the access information indicates the securable compartment is authorized for access, and restrict access to the securable compartment when the access information indicates the securable compartment is not authorized for access. The medical supply station also includes a critical access module configured to, upon actuation, bypass the access information required by the controller and permit substantially immediate access to the securable compartment. The medical supply station further includes an image capturing device, coupled to the critical access module, configured to capture at least one image of an area proximal to the medical supply station in response to actuation of the critical access module.","['G16H10/60', 'H04N5/147']","['G16H', 'H04N']",32,1.0,US20230114515A1,"A61,G08B,A61B5/14542,G08,G,A61B5/01,G16H40/00,G06F,A61B5/1112,G16H40/60,A61B5/746,G08B21/0438,G16H40/67,A61B,G08B21/00,A61B5/0002,A61B5/02,G16H10/60,A,A61B5/103,G16H,G08B21/04,G08B21/043,A61B5/024,G16,G06F21/00,A61B5/0015,G06F21/60,A61B5/1118,G08B21/0453,G06F21/6218,G06F21/6245,G16H80/00,G08B21/0446,A61B5/74,A61B5/00,A61B5/145,G06F21/62,G16H10/00,A61B5/02438,G08B21/02,G08B21/24,G08B21/0407,A61B5/0205,G08B21/18,A61B5/0022,G06,A61B5/11","A mobile application is used for monitoring and management of users or patients with various health or disease conditions. Software system provides a platform with which the medical histories, the recent conditions and real-time measurement data for the patient can be organized and shared among various people who are involved in the caring of the patient. In addition to data sharing in a secured, private networking environment