US2010179835A1,Relating multiple electronic health records,"A computer-implemented method for alerting one or more members of a connected health network is provided, wherein the connected health network includes two or more members having linked medical records. The method includes receiving a change in a first health record of a first member, the first health record being linked to a second health record of a second member based on a specified relationship. The method also includes using the change in the first health record to determine whether a condition exists that could affect the second member, and, if so, alerting the second member of the affect of the change in the first health record on the second member.","['G06Q50/00', 'G16H10/60']","['G06Q', 'G16H']",29,1.0,US20230066299A1,"G08B5/00,A61,G08B,G08,A61B5/0022,A61B2562/00,G,G08B5/22,A61B5/01,A61B5/02055,A61B5/681,G06F,A61B5/68,G08B25/00,G08B25/10,G16H40/00,A61B5/021,G16H40/60,A61B2562/0219,G08C,G08C17/02,A61B5/7475,G08B21/0438,A61B5/002,A61B,G16H40/67,G08B21/00,A61B5/0082,A61B5/48,A61B5/1123,A61B5/6802,G16Z,A61B5/0002,A61B5/02,A61B5/1455,A63B71/00,A,A61B5/103,A61B5/6801,G06F16/20,G08B21/18,G16H,G08B21/04,G16Z99/00,A61B5/1121,A61B5/024,A61B5/1122,G16,A61B5/112,A61B5/0015,A61B5/1118,G08B21/06,G06F16/22,A63B,A61B5/1116,A61B5/4806,A61B5/74,A61B5/00,A61B5/145,A63,G06F16/00,G08C17/00,G08B21/02,G08B6/00,A61B2562/02,A61B5/0205,G08B25/01,A61B5/0059,G08B21/0446,G06,A61B5/11","In one aspect of the disclosed implementations, a device includes one or more motion sensors for sensing motion of the device and providing activity data indicative of the sensed motion. The device also includes one or more processors for monitoring the activity data, and receiving or generating annotation data for annotating the activity data with one or more markers or indicators to define one or more characteristics of an activity session. The device also includes one or more feedback devices for providing feedback, a notice, or an indication