US2022257320A1,"Systems, devices, and methods for tool skive avoidance","A system for skive avoidance includes a sensor configured to measure a force exerted on a surgical tool; at least one processor; and a memory. The memory stores instructions for execution by the at least one processor that, when executed, cause the at least one processor to: project a tool trajectory onto a three-dimensional (3D) model of bone tissue; and estimate an expected normal force direction and magnitude upon contact of the surgical tool with the bone tissue.","['A61B90/00', 'G16H20/40']","['A61B', 'G16H']",37,1.0,US20230046239A1,"A61B18/12,A61B5/6852,A61,A61B2090/065,A61B34/74,A61B2034/305,A61B90/06,A61B17/00234,G,A61M2025/0166,A61B5/061,A61B2090/064,A61B90/39,A61B2034/101,A61B5/68,A61B2017/00203,A61M,A61B1/00,A61B34/37,A61B5/6846,A61B17/00,A61B34/70,A61B2017/00017,A61M25/01,A61B2017/00292,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B2017/00809,A61B5/062,A61B2034/105,A61B34/35,A61B1/009,A61B5/06,A61B5/066,A61B18/1492,A61B2034/2061,A61B2017/00318,A61B1/2676,A,A61B2034/306,A61B2034/741,A61B2034/742,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B34/20,A61B1/005,A61B5/065,G16,A61B2034/301,A61M25/0105,A61B2034/102,A61B5/08,G16H50/50,A61B18/04,A61M25/00,A61B2017/003,A61B34/10,A61B5/00,A61B18/00,A61B90/00,A61B1/267,A61B2017/00323,A61B2034/2046,G16H50/00,A61B5/6847,A61B2034/104,A61B34/30,A61B2034/2051,A61B2017/00743",A medical system comprises a flexible device configured to be positioned at least partially within an anatomical passageway of a plurality of anatomical passageways within a patient anatomy. The medical system further comprises a memory device including computer executable instructions. The computer executable instructions are for performing operations comprising determining a deformation force exerted by a section of the flexible device. The operations further comprise registering a model of a candidate anatomical passageway of the plurality of anatomical passageways to a model of the flexible device based on: a shape of the flexibl