US2021390265A1,Natural-language medical record generation platform,"Systems and methods for generating a natural-language statement for a healthcare record are provided. A graphical user interface comprising a canvas region and a menu region is displayed, wherein menu region comprises a first set of one or more interactive graphical user interface menu objects configured to receive user inputs corresponding to medical information. Data is received representing a first user input comprising user interaction with one or more of the first set of menu objects, the first input indicating medical information for a patient. In accordance with the first user input, a natural-language statement is generated based on the medical information indicated by the first user input, and display of the canvas region is updated to display the natural-language statement.","['G06F3/0482', 'G16H10/60']","['G06F', 'G16H']",40,1.0,US20230046239A1,"A61B18/12,A61B5/6852,A61,A61B2090/065,A61B34/74,A61B2034/305,A61B90/06,A61B17/00234,G,A61M2025/0166,A61B5/061,A61B2090/064,A61B90/39,A61B2034/101,A61B5/68,A61B2017/00203,A61M,A61B1/00,A61B34/37,A61B5/6846,A61B17/00,A61B34/70,A61B2017/00017,A61M25/01,A61B2017/00292,A61B34/00,A61B,A61B2017/00809,A61B5/062,A61B2034/105,A61B34/35,A61B1/009,A61B5/06,A61B5/066,A61B18/1492,A61B2034/2061,A61B2017/00318,A61B1/2676,A,A61B2034/306,A61B2034/741,A61B2034/742,G16H,A61B18/14,A61B34/20,A61B1/005,A61B5/065,G16,A61B2034/301,A61M25/0105,A61B2034/102,A61B5/08,G16H50/50,A61B18/04,A61M25/00,A61B2017/003,A61B34/10,A61B5/00,A61B18/00,A61B90/00,A61B1/267,A61B2017/00323,A61B2034/2046,G16H50/00,A61B5/6847,A61B2034/104,A61B34/30,A61B2034/2051,A61B2017/00743",A medical system comprises a flexible device configured to be positioned at least partially within an anatomical passageway of a plurality of anatomical passageways within a patient anatomy. The medical system further comprises a memory device including computer executable instructions. The computer executable instructio