US2014085077A1,Sedentary activity management method and apparatus using data from a data-capable band for managing health and wellness,"Data-capable personal worn or carried device can be used to detect sedentary activity for facilitating achievement of health and wellness goals. In one embodiment, a method includes receiving data representing an activity originating from a wearable device, determining the data representing the activity is a sedentary activity, and characterizing the sedentary activity based on a sedentary characteristic of the sedentary activity. Also, the method can initiate generation of notification alert information indicative of the presence of a value associated with the sedentary characteristic. In some embodiment, the method can cause a vibratory energy source in the wearable device to impart the notification alert information (e.g., haptically).","['G16H40/67', 'A61B5/681']","['G16H', 'A61B']",29,1.0,US20230076443A1,"H04W4/21,H04L51/10,H04W4/023,G16H40/00,A61B5/1112,H04L67/00,H04W52/00,G06F16/90,G06F16/95,H,G16H50/30,G16H40/67,G06F21/552,G16Z,A61B5/6887,H04W24/04,G16,G06F2221/21,G06F21/00,A61B5/1118,H04M1/72457,H04L51/52,H04W4/025,H04L,H04L67/50,Y02D,Y02D30/00,H04M1/72454,A61B5/7267,H04M,H04L51/07,H04L67/535,A61B5/6898,H04L51/08,A61B5/746,H04L51/222,H04W4/02,H04W52/0229,H04W4/00,H04M1/72448,G16Z99/00,H04W64/00,H04W4/029,H04W24/00,H04W52/0251,A61B5/7465,G06F2221/00,A61B5/7282,A61B5/72,H04M1/00,G06F21/50,G16H50/00,Y02D30/70,Y,G06F16/953,G,A61B5/68,G16H40/60,H04W4/027,H04M1/72,H04L51/58,A61B5/48,H04W4/20,A61B5/7235,A,A61B5/742,G16H15/00,H04W52/0225,A61B5/4866,G16H,H04W4/12,H04W4/30,H04W64/006,G16H50/20,A61B5/74,H04W52/0254,G06F16/00,A61B5/7455,A61B5/11,G16H50/70,A61,G06F,G06F21/55,H04W52/02,H04,H04M1/724,A61B,A61B5/1123,H04W4/33,A61B5/103,G16H40/63,Y02,H04W52/0209,H04L51/00,H04W24/08,G16H80/00,A61B5/7264,A61B5/00,G06F16/9535,H04L51/21,A61B5/7246,G06F2221/2111,A61B5/7271,H04W,G06","A method, system, and/or apparatus for automatically monitorin